SWEET WLAN stage 3 run B (patch 0130, W-D3 step 2, docs/research/43 rows W8..W10): the first TCM writes, behind boot-arg sweetwlan=4 (level 4 = stage 1 at level 2, run A of 0129, then W8-W10; levels 1-3 are byte-identical to 0129).
